Alembic migration environment (async SQLAlchemy 2.x).

Create a migration after changing models:
    uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "add x to y"

Apply:
    uv run alembic upgrade head

Roll back one step:
    uv run alembic downgrade -1

Always read the generated file before applying it. Autogenerate does not detect
everything (table/column renames look like drop+create, which destroys data).
